<h1>凶暴猿 (Dire Ape)</h1>
<table class="d chm-compat-grid" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:20px 0;font-size:14px;background:#fefcf7;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;"><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#eee6d8;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">资料栏位</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#eee6d8;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;">凶暴猿 (Dire Ape)<br/><small>大型动物</small></td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">生命骰</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">5d8+13(35HP)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">先攻</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">+2</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">速度</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">30英尺(6格)、攀爬15英尺</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">防御等级</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">15(-1体型、+2敏捷、+4天生)、接触11、措手不及13</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">基本攻击/擒抱</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">+3 / +13</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">攻击</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">爪抓+8近战(1d6+6)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">全力攻击</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">2爪抓+8近战(1d6+6)及啮咬+3近战(1d8+3)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">占据/触及</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">10英尺 / 10英尺</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">特殊攻击</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">撕扯2d6+9</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">特殊能力</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">昏暗视觉、灵敏嗅觉</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">豁免</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">强韧+6、反射+6、意志+5</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">属性</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">力量22、敏捷15、体质14、智力2、感知12、魅力7</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">技能</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">攀爬+14、聆听+5、潜行+4、侦察+6</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">专长</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">警觉、健壮</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">环境</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">热暖带森林</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">组织</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">单独或一伙(5-8)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">挑战级数</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">3</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">宝藏</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">无</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">阵营</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">总是绝对中立</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">进化</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">6-15HD(大型)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">等级修正值</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">—</td></tr></table>
<p>巨大、凶猛的猿，体型与食人魔差不多，但更加强壮。其胸部圆而宽，躯体长有浓密的黑毛，手臂长，口鼻部宽。利爪与尖牙看似不可侵犯。</p>
<p>凶暴猿地域性强，倾向攻击任何看到的生物。</p>
<p>凶暴猿约9英尺高，800至1200磅重。</p>
<span class="s">战斗</span>
<p>凶暴猿攻击任何进入领地的生物，即使同是凶暴猿也一样。若对方防具阻挠其攻击，凶暴猿就会尝试擒抱压制，再对倒地的敌人施以撕扯攻击。</p>
<div class="a"><p><b>撕扯(特异)：</b>如果凶暴猿的2次爪抓都命中同一个对手，就可抓住并撕裂对方身体，自动额外造成2d6+9点伤害。</p></div>
<div class="a"><p><b>技能：</b>凶暴猿在进行"攀爬"检定时具有+8种族加值。即使被冲撞或受威胁，他们在进行"攀爬"检定时都可以随时取10。</p></div>
